# gnn_oracle experiment scratch: harvested corpora, built-graph caches, and
# checkpoints. Multi-GB and fully reproducible from tools/mlopt/bakeoff.py.
# Deliberately NOT `tools/mlopt/*.pt`: gnn_genius.pt and its predecessors are
# tracked artifacts, and a broad rule here would quietly shadow them.
tools/mlopt/_bakeoff/
tools/mlopt/_graphcache/
tools/mlopt/_bakeoff.log
